{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Do you know the story of Luminous?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uplifting music and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting work in which you defeat more and more monsters in the world of swords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Luminous Storia&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An impressive character advances through the ruins with the village's treasured sword</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boy's name is Luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A villager living in a remote village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He wants to be a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that anyone who sees Luminous will be praised by everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck took out the village sword to be praised by everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to be like a hero.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck is determined in his heart,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He headed to the ruins where monsters were wandering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins of a monster that villagers do not approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Luck be able to see the Luminous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEasy operation with gamepad, simple sword attack and jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSwing the sword down at the monster, cut vertically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSwing the sword from the side, cross</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAttack quickly, thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUse three different attacks to defeat monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExplore by pressing a switch to open a closed door</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLet's go see Luminous with Luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1SOUND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythmic high-quality background music that beats the world of swords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1SYSTEM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEvery time you attack a monster, you get experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRaise your level and defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067390?t=1760149573","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067390?t=1760149573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067390/7d9731046699f4c8e22aafc8a424a16ec5b6f7e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760149573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067390/7d9731046699f4c8e22aafc8a424a16ec5b6f7e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760149573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Do you know the story of Luminous?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl